=6A972037"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "vlcsnap-2020-07-19-15h38m55s089.png", "id": "736791198517954", "uri": "https://scontent-qro1-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031532_736791201851287_4149678069899420458_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=epuJqJhHSa4Q7kNvwFw0QxA&_nc_oc=AdqMWbiCa9rtyS-xP336850qWeZ_wzycSPQwcszAXrFBJIIFsGM8vpKRfgc7re3UDZ0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-qro1-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQFM_f5tR4cPlXkJ2azbEXh4zdsE6nbuu34otPgnr2wPCw&oe=6A974A06"}, "display_name": "EscapeVR: The Basement", "keywords": ["escape", "escaperoom", "roomescape", "puzzle", "logic"], "long_description": "EscapeVR: The Basement is an 'Escape The Room' genre game which was inspired by real-life escape games and written from the ground up as a room-scale virtual reality experience.\n\nExplore the environment, solve puzzles, discover useful items, investigate clues, and find your way through a total of seven rooms in three areas to -hopefully- escape the basement!\n\n- Solve over a dozen puzzles, which includes smaller ones like finding keys or codes up to large ones which involve complex interactions with daunting machinery.\n\n- Explore three distinct areas with seven rooms, a total of 130 square meters, and more than 200 items to interact with. The game is designed for room scale and features a teleporting system.\n\n- In case you get stuck, a built-in hint system provides you with clues. You\u2019ll also get in-game statistics about your performance, and there are achievements to unlock!\n\nWill you take on the challenge? Will you manage to escape the basement?", "short_description": "You find yourself locked in the cell of an unknown basement with nothing else than a bed and a toilet. Can you escape? Explore the environment, solve puzzles, investigate clues, and find your way through a total of 7 rooms to -hopefully- escape the basement of this VR escape room game."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_ur